        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana PCT400, Traditional Decorative Cabinet Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAny great designer will tell you that it is all in the finishing touches. The Traditional 4 Inch Cabinet Handle is available in 8 finishes so you will be able to find the perfect finishing touch for your own space, be it in the kitchen, on your office desk, or in the bathroom on the vanity. It comes packaged with screws for easy installation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-PCT400-size.gif?v=1704354569\" width=\"534\" height=\"183\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana PCT400 Decorative Cabinet Pull Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/3-inch-traditional-beaded-cabinet-handle-deltana-pct300\"><b>3\" Decorative Cabinet Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/beaded-3-1-2-inch-traditional-cabinet-pull-deltana-pct350\"><b>3-1/2\" Decorative Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana PCT400 Decorative Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 4\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/PCT400.pdf?v=1691095374\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana PCT400 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose, the cabinet handle will still be <b>high quality solid brass</b>. \r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Traditional 4 Inch Cabinet Handle | Deltana PCT400",
                "description": "Traditional Decorative Cabinet Handle Deltana PCT400 - Any great designer will tell you that it is all in the finishing touches. The Traditional 4 Inch Cabinet Handle is available in 8 finishes so you will be able to find the perfect finishing touch for your own space, be it in the kitchen, on your office desk, or in the bathroom on the vanity. It comes packaged with screws for easy installation.\r\n",
